{"text": "Paris & O'Brien, Attorneys at Law - Case status report\n\nWeek of October 26, 2026. Prepared by Chase Montgomery, paralegal, for the Monday docket meeting. Internal - do not forward to clients.\n\nActive matters\n\nMatter\tCourt no.\tAtty\tNext event\n\nBenedetti Bros. Paving v. Clackamas Valley S&G\t23CV41877\tJP\tMSJ hearing 11/09/2026\n\nPham v. Rose City Mutual\t3:26-cv-00512-HZ\tSOB\tRule 30(b)(6) depo 11/12/2026\n\nIn re Estate of Lucille Beaumont\t26PB03391\tSOB\tInventory due 12/01/2026\n\nAsante-Boateng adv. Sellwood Animal Hosp.\t26CV18820\tJP\tAnswer due 11/05/2026\n\nNotes by matter\n\nBenedetti. Client contact is Aurelio Benedetti (503-555-0143). Aurelio wants to know why we have not moved under ORCP 47 already; Jordan Paris explained the paving invoices ($214,600 claimed, $61,250.75 admitted) are the only part ripe for it. Defendant's full name for the caption is Clackamas Valley Sand & Gravel Co. The hearing is in Dept. 14. Trial readiness under UTCR 5.050 is not yet set.\n\nPham. Thanh Huong Pham's homeowner claim, policy HO-3 8841207-02, claim no. RCM-2026-004417, for the January 13 ice-storm loss at 6120 SE Tolman Street, Portland, OR 97206. Rose City Mutual Insurance Company has paid $18,400 against our estimate of $96,000. Ms. Pham needs a Vietnamese interpreter for her deposition prep; she also asked that we not schedule anything on her dialysis days (Tues/Thurs). The adjuster's claim portal is at https://claims.rosecitymutual.example/c/004417.\n\nBeaumont estate. Personal representative is Winifred Achterberg, the decedent's niece. Ms. Beaumont died August 30, 2026 at 97. Assets so far: house in Sellwood, a 2011 Subaru Outback (Oregon plate 417 KBD, VIN 4S4BRBKC7B3398104), and about $340k at two banks. Winifred found a second will in a kitchen drawer; Siobhan O'Brien is reviewing.\n\nAsante-Boateng. We defend Kwame Asante-Boateng, a former vet tech sued by Sellwood Animal Hospital, P.C. on a non-compete. Amount in controversy is under $10,000 so ORS 20.080 fees are in play. Kwame is a shop steward with Local 88 at his new job and thinks the suit is payback for the organizing drive. Jordan says keep that theory in our pocket for now.\n\nDeadlines needing a decision\n\n- Pham: expert disclosure. Retainer for the roofing expert is $3,500; client has not approved.\n\n- Beaumont: bond waiver from the three heirs.\n\n- Timekeeping: Chase is out 11/11; send filings to the front desk.", "kind": "Web page", "detail": "376 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Chase Montgomery", "Jordan Paris", "Aurelio Benedetti", "Thanh Huong Pham", "Winifred Achterberg", "Siobhan O'Brien", "Kwame Asante-Boateng", "Pham", "Beaumont", "Chase"], "companies": ["Benedetti Bros. Paving", "Clackamas Valley S&G", "Rose City Mutual", "Sellwood Animal Hosp.", "Oregon", "Southwest Oregon", "Local 88", "Sellwood Animal Hospital", "Rose City Mutual Insurance Company", "Oregon Protective Services", "Chase"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.599999999627471, "modelMs": 35319, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "passport_dl", "routing", "phone", "record", "vin", "account", "money", "dob", "age90", "date", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "text": "Paris", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Jordan Paris"}, {"start": 8, "end": 15, "text": "O'Brien", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Siobhan O'Brien"}, {"start": 64, "end": 80, "text": "October 26, 2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "October 26, 2026"}, {"start": 94, "end": 110, "text": "Chase Montgomery", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Chase Montgomery"}, {"start": 243, "end": 265, "text": "Benedetti Bros. Paving", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Benedetti Bros. Paving"}, {"start": 269, "end": 289, "text": "Clackamas Valley S&G", "kind": "company", "source